#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:5
#: c7bc8912254f494faa181f1ca4813df5
msgid "Rally Points"
msgstr "集结点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:8
#: 9b1cd7ea647c4659adbac562be810915
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:10
#: fa5ae961337646be9809115920a62905
msgid ""
"Ordinarily when a plane or copter enters :ref:`Return to Launch (RTL) <rtl-"
"mode>` mode (typically triggered by an autopilot \\ :ref:`failsafe <apms-"
"failsafe-function>`), the default behaviour is to return to the \\ "
":ref:`Home point <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-"
"events_setting_the_home_position>`, but there are often cases when that can "
"be undesirable. For example it may be an area full of people or property and"
" a system running in RTL mode may very likely be in a state that merits "
"extreme caution!  It is also possible that the flight plan is large enough "
"that should the aircraft enter RTL mode it is undesirable to traverse all "
"the way back to the point of takeoff."
msgstr ""
"通常情况下，当 Plane 或 Copter 进入 :ref:`返航（RTL）<rtl-mode>` 模式（通常由飞控 :ref:`失控保护 "
"<apms-failsafe-function>` 触发）时，默认行为是返回 :ref:`Home 点 <common-planning-a-"
"mission-with-waypoints-and-"
"events_setting_the_home_position>`，但在很多情况下这可能并不理想。例如，该区域可能有很多人或财产，处于 RTL "
"模式的系统很可能处于需要极度谨慎的状态！此外，飞行计划范围可能足够大，使得进入 RTL 模式时返回起飞点是不理想的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:21
#: bc7069e1d6da45939fa8287674820fb5
msgid ""
"For this reason we now support the creation of multiple Rally Points. Should"
" an aircraft enter RTL and Rally Points have been defined then it will "
"proceed to the closest Rally Point, rather than proceeding to the Home "
"position. Plane will then loiter at that location, and Copter will perform "
"an automated landing there."
msgstr ""
"为此，我们支持创建多个集结点。如果飞行器进入 RTL 且已定义了集结点，它将前往最近的集结点，而非返回 Home 位置。Plane "
"将在该位置盘旋，Copter 将在那里执行自动降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:30
#: 7b463c14789f4f1091fc2836590fc33c
msgid ""
"A flight plan with Rally Points. Rally Points are denoted with Purpleplace "
"markers. Mousing over a Rally Point will give its loiter altitude(as in the "
"middle point above)."
msgstr "带集结点的飞行计划。集结点以紫色地点标记表示。将鼠标悬停在集结点上可显示其盘旋高度（如上图中间点所示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:34
#: 51782395093947eab2b59390f95b39ff
msgid "Setting Up Rally Points"
msgstr "设置集结点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:36
#: bff6303048ba4784b1504a1c5dc619aa
msgid ""
"The following steps are for specifying Rally Points in Mission Planner:"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中设置集结点的步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:38
#: 7f0596f788d8405cb8fc2466b672d936
msgid ""
"Rally Point latitude and longitude.To set a Rally Point's location, right "
