"relative to the home location):"
msgstr "需要指定集结点的盘旋高度（注意集结点的默认高度是默认航点高度值，相对于 Home 位置）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:56
#: e9e1b3235982406c87a37fcb45c1cd02
msgid "Repeat for all desired Rally points!"
msgstr "对所有需要的集结点重复以上操作！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:57
#: d185ecb27477405d8b9b0b23571151de
msgid ""
"Upload to the vehicle by selecting Rally Points > Upload from the right-"
"click popup menu"
msgstr "通过右键弹出菜单选择「Rally Points」>「Upload」上传到飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:60
#: 269daf126a6a4ca7b7060e42ea6ab2d7
msgid "The following should be considered when using Rally Points:"
msgstr "使用集结点时应注意以下事项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:62
#: 4caaf4c5a8c340f091c434f8f02a1060
msgid ""
"If using a :ref:`geofence <geofencing>`: its HIGHLY recommended the Rally "
"Points you intend to use at your event are inside the geofence."
msgstr "如果使用 :ref:`电子围栏 <geofencing>`：强烈建议您在活动中打算使用的集结点位于电子围栏内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:65
#: c312f52cb4034c0c9ba93eba638dc2c9
msgid ""
"Make sure Rally Point altitudes are high enough to clear terrain and "
"buildings."
msgstr "确保集结点高度足够高，可以避开地形和建筑物。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:67
#: 453ced9c1ff84d6aae7b6cd31098fefd
msgid ""
"Because of the limited flash memory size on the APM2.x hardware the number "
"of Rally Points is restricted to 10 on Plane and 6 on Copter -- this limit "
"may be expanded on other platforms such as Pixhawk in the future."
msgstr ""
"由于 APM2.x 硬件闪存容量有限，集结点数量限制为 Plane 最多 10 个，Copter 最多 6 个——此限制在 Pixhawk "
"等其他平台上将来可能会扩大。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:70
#: 27c26e0b59654ebdb13179adf3547002
msgid ""
"On Plane, loiter radius for a Rally Point is the same as all other loiter "
"points; determined by the :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 上，集结点的盘旋半径与所有其他盘旋点相同，由 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>` 参数决定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:73
#: 5539d250393a42529e9139108a0874e8
msgid ""
"The :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` or :ref:`RTL_ALT <copter:RTL_ALT>` "
"parameters are NOT used with Rally Points! The aircraft will transit to the "
"Rally Point at the altitude specified when adding that point."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` 或 :ref:`RTL_ALT <copter:RTL_ALT>` "
"参数不适用于集结点！飞行器将以添加该点时指定的高度飞向集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:78
#: 27589c01ad6a4eaab1b2d981f02d64d5
msgid "The following MAVLink parameters control Rally Point behavior:"
msgstr "以下 MAVLink 参数控制集结点行为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:80
#: 03d1d1e23a034c0faa86fbbe4adf5318
msgid ""
":ref:`RALLY_LIMIT_KM <RALLY_LIMIT_KM>` is the maximum distance a Rally Point"
" may be from the aircraft to be considered for an RTL event.  If all Rally "
"Points are greater than this distance from the aircraft, then the Home "
"location is used for RTL events (at altitude :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE "
"<RTL_ALTITUDE>`) This parameter is to prevent fly offs if Rally Points have "
"been specified for multiple flying fields. This parameter can be disabled if"
" set to 0."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RALLY_LIMIT_KM <RALLY_LIMIT_KM>` 是集结点与飞行器的最大距离，超过此距离将不被 RTL "
"事件考虑。如果所有集结点与飞行器的距离都超过此值，则 RTL 事件将使用 Home 位置（高度为 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE "
"<RTL_ALTITUDE>`）。此参数是为了防止在多个飞行场地指定了集结点时飞离。将此参数设置为 0 可禁用该限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:87
#: 72332c2d9bc44a5eb39b2127fd86d623
msgid ""
":ref:`RALLY_INCL_HOME<RALLY_INCL_HOME>` allows Home to be included in the "
"RALLY points, allowing it to return to home if closer than any RALLY point."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RALLY_INCL_HOME<RALLY_INCL_HOME>` 允许将 Home 加入集结点列表，使其在比任何集结点都近时返回 "
"Home。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:88
#: 4ad4d08879f94c268447b463e246d069
msgid ""
":ref:`RALLY_TOTAL <RALLY_TOTAL>` is the number of Rally Points currently "
"specified. This parameter will be set for you by your ground control station"
" (e.g., Mission Planner) when you add and remove Rally Points.  **IT IS "
"HIGHLY UNLIKELY YOU WANT TO SET THIS PARAMETER MANUALLY AND IT IS PROBABLY "
"UNSAFE TO DO SO**.  RALLY_TOTAL should be 0 if you have specified no Rally "
"Points and in this case the Home location will be used for RTL events."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RALLY_TOTAL <RALLY_TOTAL>` 是当前指定的集结点数量。此参数将由地面控制站（如 Mission "
"Planner）在添加和删除集结点时自动设置。**极不建议手动设置此参数，这样做可能不安全。** 如果没有指定集结点，RALLY_TOTAL 应为 "
"0，此时 RTL 事件将使用 Home 位置。"

